description:
Add to next_app/src/services/api/fields.ts, following the existing style (see `submitReport` at line 113):

```ts
export interface FieldComment {
  id: string;
  text: string;
  createdAt: string;
  user: { id: string; name?: string | null; imageUrl?: string | null };
}

export type FieldIssueCategory = 'POTHOLE' | 'LIGHTING' | 'SURFACE' | 'GOAL_NET' | 'FENCE' | 'OTHER';
export type FieldIssueStatus = 'OPEN' | 'RESOLVED';

export interface FieldIssueReport {
  id: string;
  category: FieldIssueCategory;
  description?: string | null;
  status: FieldIssueStatus;
  createdAt: string;
}
```
Add matching methods on `fieldsApi` (object literal starting line 70):
- `getComments: (fieldId: string) => apiClient<FieldComment[]>(`/api/fields/${fieldId}/comments`, { cache: 'no-store' })`
- `addComment: (fieldId: string, text: string, token: string) => apiClient<FieldComment>(`/api/fields/${fieldId}/comments`, { method: 'POST', data: { text }, token })`
- `deleteComment: (fieldId: string, commentId: string, token: string) => apiClient<{ message: string }>(`/api/fields/${fieldId}/comments/${commentId}`, { method: 'DELETE', token })`
- `getIssues: (fieldId: string) => apiClient<FieldIssueReport[]>(`/api/fields/${fieldId}/issues`, { cache: 'no-store' })`
- `addIssue: (fieldId: string, data: { category: FieldIssueCategory; description?: string }, token: string) => apiClient<FieldIssueReport>(`/api/fields/${fieldId}/issues`, { method: 'POST', data, token })`

Do not add the admin-only PATCH /issues/:issueId method here -- no admin UI is planned in this pass (see plan notes); it can be added later if/when an admin resolve UI is built.
